  <description lang="en-GB" default="true">A decorative sword boasting 97cm in length placed on a sword rack, that is said to have been the beloved sword of Kojiro Sasaki.[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="fr-FR" default="false">Une épée décorative faisant 97cm de longueur, placée sur un râtelier à épées et dont on dit qu'elle a appartenu à Kojiro Sasaki.[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="de-DE" default="false">Ein dekoratives Schwert von unglaublichen 97cm Länge, von dem man sagt, es sei das Lieblingsschwert von Kojiro Sasaki gewesen, in einem Schwertständer.[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="it-IT" default="false">Una spada decorativa di ben 97 cm di lunghezza posta su uno scaffale da esposizione, che si dice sia stata usata da Kojiro Sasaki.[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="es-ES" default="false">Una espada decorativa con 97cm de largo colocada sobre un estante para espadas, se dice fue la espada adorada de Kojiro Sasaki.[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ja-JP" default="false">佐々木小次郎の愛刀として伝えられる、三尺二寸の長さを誇る刀を刀掛に置いて飾ったもの。[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-US" default="false">A decorative sword boasting 97cm in length placed on a sword rack, that is said to have been the beloved sword of Kojiro Sasaki.[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-SG" default="false">A decorative sword boasting 97cm in length placed on a sword rack, that is said to have been the beloved sword of Kojiro Sasaki.[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-HK" default="false">一把長達97公分的裝飾用刀，放置在刀架上，相傳是佐佐木小次郎的愛刀。[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-TW" default="false">一把長達97公分的裝飾用刀，放置在刀架上，相傳是佐佐木小次郎的愛刀。[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ko-KR" default="false">길이 97cm에 달하는 장식용 검으로, 검 거치대에 올려져 있으며 사사키 코지로가 애용한 검이라고 전해진다.[#Legal]</description>
